/**
 * The {{ name }} Domain Pack — see ADR 0001 (pack identity = Goal.label)
 * and ADR 0006 (packs self-register into core catalogs).
 *
 * Every Coach contribution catalog is wired below as a commented hook.
 * Uncomment the ones you need and add your concrete Tools / Placeholders
 * / Tips / Agent tools. Core never imports this file — that's the whole
 * point of the catalogs.
